abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline for the analysis of CYB5R3 and MTARC1 across the human
  MASLD-to-hepatocellular-carcinoma continuum, using UCSC Xena (TCGA, GTEx, PanCanAtlas),
  GEO liver-biopsy cohorts and DepMap.
